# Session transcripts. Parked working files, never part of the corpus -- gitignored so a
# broad `git add` cannot sweep one in. The catalog repo learned this the hard way: the same
# 573-line parked file was swept into two different lanes a week apart, byte for byte, and
# reversing it the first time left it merely untracked rather than ignored.
chat*.md
